WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.290
Unit nine. Caring for My Skin!

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.982
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.032 --> 00:00:11.629
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.679 --> 00:00:15.599
Today we learn about Caring for My Skin. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.397 --> 00:00:19.980
Skin. Say it with me. Skin!

6
00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:26.971
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

7
00:00:30.451 --> 00:00:34.068
Sunscreen. Say it with me. Sunscreen!

8
00:00:37.574 --> 00:00:40.824
Cut. Say it with me. Cut!

9
00:00:44.346 --> 00:00:47.846
Rash. Say it with me. Rash!

10
00:00:51.306 --> 00:00:54.573
Itch. Say it with me. Itch!

11
00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:01.258
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

12
00:01:04.763 --> 00:01:08.329
Protect. Say it with me. Protect!

13
00:01:11.825 --> 00:01:21.600
My skin protects my body from germs. I wash every day and use sunscreen outdoors. If I have a cut, rash, or itch, I keep it clean and tell an adult.

14
00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:22.951
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.981 --> 00:01:29.194
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.244 --> 00:01:30.394
Sunscreen!

17
00:01:31.379 --> 00:01:36.596
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.646 --> 00:01:37.796
Clean!

19
00:01:38.547 --> 00:01:42.597
Did you know? Your skin is the largest organ of your body!

20
00:01:42.647 --> 00:01:44.869
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:53.444
Think and answer. How does your skin protect you?

22
00:01:53.494 --> 00:01:54.644
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.693 --> 00:02:00.604
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.654 --> 00:02:03.328
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

